        {
          "text": "Kaakano eri oyo ayinza okubanyweza ng'enjiri yange n'okubuulira mu Kristo Yesu bwe biri, ng'ekyama ky'okubikkulirwa eby'ebiro eby'emirembe n'emirembe ebyasirikirwa, bwe kiri,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.16.25",
