        {
          "text": "kaakano nga bannabbi bwe baayogerera mu byawandiikibwa, ng'ekiragiro kya Katonda ataggwaawo bwe kiri, olw'okugonda mu kukkiriza eri Abaamawanga bonna abaamanyibwa,",
